    answer: 1
    why: The first Congress session met in Bombay in December 1885.
  - text: Why did Gandhi call off the Non-Cooperation Movement in 1922?
    options:
    - "The Gandhi\u2013Irwin Pact"
    - The violence at Chauri Chaura
    - The Lahore Congress
    - The Poona Pact
    answer: 1
    why: He suspended it after the violence at Chauri Chaura.
  - text: What was the slogan of the Indian National Army under Subhas Chandra Bose?
    options:
    - Do or die
    - Delhi Chalo
    - Inquilab Zindabad
    - Vande Mataram
    answer: 1
    why: Bose rallied the INA with the call Delhi Chalo.
  - text: Where was the All-India Muslim League founded in 1906?
    options:
    - Lahore
    - Aligarh
    - Dhaka
    - Karachi
    answer: 2
    why: The League was founded in Dhaka in 1906.
  - text: What was the 1948 military action that integrated Hyderabad called?
    options:
    - Operation Vijay
    - Operation Polo
    - Operation Flood
    - Operation Blue Star
    answer: 1
    why: India launched Operation Polo in September 1948.
  - text: Which 1973 case established that the basic structure of the Constitution cannot be destroyed?
    options:
    - Golaknath case
    - Kesavananda Bharati case
    - Minerva Mills case
    - Maneka Gandhi case
    answer: 1
    why: The Supreme Court laid down the basic structure doctrine in Kesavananda Bharati.
